      "id": "pertinence",
      "name": "Pertinence",
      "description": "La pertinence du lead pour l'offre : le prospect exploite-t-il ou prépare-t-il ce que le profil cible ?",
      "enabled": true,
      "provider_id": null,
      "system_prompt": "You judge whether a company is a relevant prospect for the offer, using the relevance criteria. Base your answers only on what the documents state.\n\nRelevance criteria: The organization operates its own identity infrastructure, such as a self-hosted Keycloak, or pays for a SaaS IAM, and shows signs of migration, staffing or procurement around it. Physical access control and unrelated directories are not relevant.\n\nCriteria for job offers: The job offer is for an engineer, architect or administrator who builds or runs the organization's own identity infrastructure, for example Keycloak, or who migrates it from a SaaS IAM. Offers that only require using SSO as an end user, or roles in physical access control, are not relevant.",
